            "<p>Anti-A &amp; Anti-B</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "gyqw0nt",
      "content": "O negative is Universal Donor. AB positive is Universal Recipient. Rh factor determines positive or negative type."
    },
    {
      "id": "ttp5t7c",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "7 Plasma & Serum"
    },
    {
      "type": "comparisonTable",
