            "<p>One cell thick</p>",
            "<p>Connect artery &amp; vein</p>",
            "<p>Exchange gases</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hz321ra",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "10 Heart Structure & Working"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "rzt8gxb",
      "content": "• Four chambers: 2 atria, 2 ventricles."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "74y93mz",
      "content": "• Right side: Deoxygenated blood."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "eenqnkc",
      "content": "• Left side: Oxygenated blood."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "fjheght",
      "content": "• SA node is pacemaker."
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Distinguish clearly between Red Blood Cells (RBC), White Blood Cells (WBC), and Platelets in terms of function and lifespan.",
        "Master the concepts of Blood Groups, Rh Factor compatibility, and transfusion rules.",
        "Focus on the step-by-step Blood Clotting Mechanism and key clotting factors.",
        "Understand the structural and functional differences between major Blood Vessels and the Heart."
      ],
      "id": "kbjx61t"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "32drrso",
      "content": "• Normal heart rate: 72 beats/min."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "isishnr",
      "content": "• Double circulation present."
    },
    {
      "id": "fkz46xp",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "11 Quick Revision Points"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "27d7sia",
      "content": "1. Blood pH is 7.4."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "4h1upne",
      "content": "2. RBC life span is 120 days."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ms73ufi",
      "content": "3. O− universal donor; AB+ universal recipient."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "kkcp15d",
      "content": "4. Serum = Plasma – Fibrinogen."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "fck5d4y",
      "content": "5. Arteries carry blood away from heart."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "zm4rqbs",
      "content": "6. Human heart has four chambers."
    }
  ],
  "enriched": true
}